  unitName: Water Bulb
  unitId: 820034
  unitNumber: 8026
  description: Once a budding plant that has harnessed the essence of water by enduring
    flash floods and heavy rain. Some travelers capture them before traversing through
    deserts and it is said that consuming just a drop from the water bulb would hydrate
    the entire body of a normal man. On the other hand, consuming too much from the
    water bulb would drown one self.
